1
00:00:02,926 --> 00:00:03,937
This is getting bad

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:05,140
Are those two
going to fight?

3
00:00:05,214 --> 00:00:06,548
F***
why are you suddenly…

4
00:00:10,123 --> 00:00:11,123
F***

5
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:13,189
Stop it, Hyeon-wu

6
00:00:14,542 --> 00:00:16,475
