16
00:00:40,082 --> 00:00:41,082
Huh?

17
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:42,333
I won't fight

18
00:00:43,237 --> 00:00:44,918
Huh? He's not fighting?

19
00:00:52,837 --> 00:00:54,077
Wait for me, Hyeon-wu

20
00:00:59,325 --> 00:01:01,357
He listened to him

21
00:01:02,223 --> 00:01:03,939
Was Il-tak always close
to Hyeon-wu?

22
00:01:23,625 --> 00:01:25,237
Hey, Hong Il-tak
